77be9a8 3x"}, "body": "你好 豆乳老师！我是您的忠实粉丝，如果可以的话，我想为我的原创角色绘制一幅插图。\n\n参考资料： https://toyhou.se/30331315.sacrosancta-ecclesia-skeb/30334468.the-prologue-purgatory?key=wqo9lpql7XrH5MU\n\n我希望插图是参考链接中的天使。虽然他是一个神圣的存在，但他冷酷而骄傲。他的表情通常冷酷、犀利、面无表情。虽然他是男性，但外表有点娘娘腔。我非常喜欢老师的角色设计，所以我很希望看到重新设计，但您也可以选择绘制现有的设计。可以是第一版，也可以是第二版，当然也可以混合搭配。\n\n请自由发挥！感谢您考虑我的请求！", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 852565, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "ぐじゃ太🍼", "screen_name": "NrU6c", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1611751118153093120/vq6gsoGB.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/775633948697202688/1680187723/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 100, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 32}, {"id": 1611799, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "tefu", "screen_name": "eiftnr", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1667864193750691840/LbRO1G8b.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1333249438144368641/1776431182/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 8, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 17}, {"id": 2938425, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "洗礼", "screen_name": "senreibaby", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1641672507072872448/KPae6pNj.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1555998274502688769/1744992525/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": nul